MORET_BEGIN
RESEAU 3x3 correct
* Hypothese : H35a reseau 3x3 de spheres HEU (pas 15 cm), maille 0 0 0 au centre de la 1re cellule (-15 -15 0)
* Attendu    : NORMAL END, keff de reference pour H35b

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 BOX 22.5 22.5 7.5
    VOLU box 0 1 VIDE 0. 0. 0.
    TYPE 2 BOX 7.5 7.5 7.5
    VOLU cell box 2 VIDE -15. -15. 0.
    TYPE 3 SPHE 7.4
    HOLE h cell 3 sph -15. -15. 0.
    LATS
      MPRI cell
      DIML 3 3 1
    ENDL
  ENDM
  MODU sph
    TYPE 1 SPHE 7.4
    VOLU 1 0 1 UMET 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
    COMP VIDE
      CONC
        O16 1.0E-08
    ENDC
  ENDM

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 100
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
